 the  disappearing middle class unless we have  a new political movement in this country  that stands up and fights against the  billion at the power of the billionaire  class right sander sanders I'm going to  ask you another question about an issue  area where you're trailing senator  Clinton or Secretary Clinton and this  area you were being shellacked in our  poll which is foreign policy XP  experience in Iowa 80 for 23 of Hillary  Clinton leading and in New Hampshire 84  28 you are clearly to her left in terms  of national security in terms of foreign  policy I would say just it just again  explain why you think you're being  shellacked to that excites and what your  case is that you would be a better  foreign policy president that Hillary  Clinton good fair question the answer is  it goes without saying that when you are  the Secretary of State the United States  of America for four years by definition  you have an enormous amount of  experience in foreign policy no one can  debate that I was not Secretary of State  in fact I'm not on the Foreign Relations  Committee and I'm not on the Armed  Forces committee but this is what I will  tell you Hillary Clinton back in 2003  and I both have the same information  with regard to the wisdom of going into  Iraq not only that I vote against  war in Iraq but I helped lead the  opposition to that warrant I looked very  hard at the most important foreign  policy issue of the last several decades  and that is the war in Iraq I was right  on that issue Hillary Clinton was wrong  on that issue from

